-- Start leaves the lower clouds visible. Field rebuilding clears obsolete menu
-  window reservations and waits for fresh weather sprites before cloud uploads.
-- A focused triple-layer buffer test preserves BG2 artwork above cloud BG3 and
-  leaves the BG1 buffer unchanged.
-
-The recording is actual emulator output at GBA frame timing, enlarged with
-nearest-neighbor scaling; captions are outside the game image. The current
-stress fixture produced 583 game updates over 600 video frames while idle,
-and 85/90 and 84/90 while scrolling right/left (roughly 56-58 updates/second).
-This is not a claim of locked 60 fps. The optional lower layer plus silhouettes
